  Occupation: Student
  CharacterDescription: "Quiet, wide-eyed, and speaks in a soft, airy voice for
    a girl of eleven. She has a habit of staring at the player\u2019s chin or hands
    rather than their eyes. "
  CharacterArc: Her arc is about a child's coping mechanisms breaking down. As the
    world becomes more terrifying, she clings harder to games of pretend and imagination
    to explain away the horror around her, until the line between her games and
    the apocalypse disappears completely.
  DateOfBirth: 12/06/1978
